First off, except the congratulations to all the winning ideas, is a gigantic THANK YOU from Mental himself, to all of the participants!

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/31398110/10b9f38bad03213ff4b2d12471810de5953f94e9.png[/img]

We got so many cool techniques for the ongoing #howtokillsam series, that the faith in the successful defeat of Sam is finally restored!

[h1]Mental thought long and hard about this, and the choice had to be perfectly effective! It was not easy, but he finally came to the concluding ideas:
[/h1]

